{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "新年明けましておめでとうございます🐴"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログ更新遅くなってしまいごめんなさい(><)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46、6期生の鈴木佑捺です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日もブログを開いてくださりありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "12月31日、第76回紅白歌合戦\n本当にありがとうございました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202601/mobXftj5Z.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "謎の02"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202601/mobVxrgwa.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あまりにも眩しい年末と、その場所の重みを知った 時 でした。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どんなに愛があっても形にすることは容易じゃない、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでもそこに在り続ける「乃木坂46」が本当にかっこよかったです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "その場所に連れてきてくださった先輩方、応援してくださるファンの皆さん、スタッフさんや関係者のみなさんに感謝の気持ちで溢れた年末でした。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私自身も2026年は気持ちだけじゃなくて、好きを形にする一年にします！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202601/mobc2B6kV.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202601/mob7VM18E.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして\n松尾さん矢久保さん\nご卒業おめでとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "寂しさは変わらなくて、\n最後まで笑顔のおふたりを見てなんだかもっと寂しくなったり、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先輩方のその温もりや強さを忘れないように、\nしっかり繋いでいきたいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202601/mobv0OMwo.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ピアスお揃いだったんだ\n友情ピアス、？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先輩方とお写真撮らせていただく機会にも恵まれ喜びの年末だったので次回のブログ写真館のように沢山載せようと思います…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年で2年目を迎える6期生\n先輩方に甘えるばかりでなくて、自分たちでしっかり強くなっていきたいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "泣いてばかりじゃだめですね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "笑顔多き一年に！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まずは今月、1/17.18に開催される\n乃木坂スター誕生！SIX LIVE\n新年一発目のライブ6期生10人で最高のパフォーマンスをお届けできるよう頑張ります！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2026年もよろしくお願い致します"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近なんだか恥ずかしくて言えてなかっけど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2026年もみなさんにたくさんの好運が訪れますように。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いっぱいの好運届けます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでくださりありがとうございました☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "佑捺"}], "source": "official"}